-- Every TYPE_* entry in Sacred Gold's single shared type-id table
-- (creatures AND items live in ONE id space — see
-- the SDK's RE notes on items (wiki: Reverse-Engineering)). The `id` is the value
-- you pass to the object create / equip path; it is the table's +0x00
-- id field, NOT the row index (the table is non-contiguous after the
-- 10 hero models).
